# Comandos que use en el CLI de cada FortiGate para sacar el running-config
# (el "show full-configuration" completo es demasiado largo para la consola).
show system global
show system interface port1
show system interface port2
show system interface VLAN10          # solo FW1
show system dns
show system dhcp server               # solo FW1
show router static
show firewall address
show firewall addrgrp
show firewall policy
show vpn ipsec phase1-interface
show vpn ipsec phase2-interface

# Estado del tunel
get vpn ipsec tunnel summary
diagnose vpn tunnel list
get router info routing-table all
